This package redistributes the docstrip-generated ``heiglogo.sty`` file
unchanged. To regenerate it from the upstream ``.dtx``:

    git clone https://github.com/HEIG-VD/logos
    cd logos/heig-vd/latex
    latex heiglogo.dtx
    cp heiglogo.sty <target>/src/texsmith_fragment_heig_logo/fragment/heiglogo.sty
